Depends: perl (>= 5.36),
         homelab-common,
         libmojolicious-perl,
         libyaml-libyaml-perl,
         libmojo-pg-perl,
         adduser
Recommends: homelab-database, homelab-pgbouncer, homelab-api, homelab-sso
Description: File storage web UI for the homelab-* ecosystem
 A BFF-style Mojolicious app: browsers talk only to this app, never
 directly to homelab-api or homelab-sso. Login is delegated entirely to
 homelab-sso via an OAuth2-style authorization-code flow
 (Homelab::Common::SSOClient) -- this app never sees a password, and a
 live homelab-sso IdP session lets a user land here already logged in.
 The resulting token is held in its own session cookie and re-verified
 against homelab-api (Homelab::Common::AuthClient) on every request.
 Upload/list/download/delete files, stored on local disk under
 /var/lib/homelab/drive-storage, indexed in its own `drive` Postgres
 schema (split runtime/migrate roles, see CLAUDE.md). Registers itself
 in homelab-api's service registry on startup.
